t x="600.1" y="579.9" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-35" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endFill=1;endArrow=open;endSize=8;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#142027;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="509.0" y="294.4" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="353.5" y="364.7" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-36" value="«extend»" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0b7a6b;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="390" y="303" width="66" height="15" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-37" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endFill=1;endArrow=open;endSize=8;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#142027;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="369.0" y="385.2" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="473.8" y="394.2" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-38" value="«include»" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0b7a6b;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="386" y="370" width="73" height="15" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-39" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endFill=1;endArrow=open;endSize=8;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#142027;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="357.7" y="487.8" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="508.5" y="419.6" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-40" value="«include»" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0b7a6b;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="388" y="426" width="73" height="15" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7024-41" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Student&lt;/strong&gt; е примарен актер: стрелките одат од него кон View Availability, Book Room и Cancel Booking (E4 sol p.2–3). &lt;strong&gt;Administrator&lt;/strong&gt; е надвор од границата и ги иницира Approve Booking и Generate Report.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Send Notification&lt;/strong&gt; е «include» и од Book Room и од Cancel Booking, бидејќи известувањето се праќа СЕКОГАШ. Стрелката оди од базниот кон вклучениот use case.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request Approval&lt;/strong&gt; е «extend» на Book Room, бидејќи се случува САМО за простории што бараат одобрение. Тоа е алтернативниот тек 4a–7a од E4 sol p.2. Стрелката оди од проширувањето кон Book Room.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Во решението на E4 нема include/extend; додадени се тука за да се види нотацијата. На испит е доволно ако ги покажете само ако задачата ги наведува (спомнува „always“, „optionally“, „if“).&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#142027;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="676" width="900" height="254" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="2084-44" name="2 · Entity-relationship diagram"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="779" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2084-1" value="2 · Entity-relationship diagram" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142027;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="0" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-2" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#5b6b73&#x27;&gt;ER дијаграм (Entity-Relationship Diagram, ERD)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#142027;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="32" width="900" height="41" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-3" value="&lt;b&gt;Scenario:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;Room Booking System (Exercise 4): a student can make many bookings; each booking is for one room; a room can be booked many times. Some bookings are approved by one administrator.&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f6f8f7;strokeColor=#d5dcd8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="73" width="900" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-4" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#142027;fillColor=#dcefe9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="215" width="170" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-5" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#142027;fillColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="215" width="170" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-6" value="Student" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112" y="221" width="67" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-7" value="StudentID (PK)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="68" y="251" width="116" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-8" value="Name" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="68" y="271" width="40" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2084-9" value="Email" style="text;html=1;align=left;vertica