parent="1"><mxGeometry x="556" y="356" width="18" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6862-42" value="A3  Show “not available”" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="58" y="388" width="191" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6862-43" value="X" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="346" y="388" width="18" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6862-44" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;3 услова → максимум 2³ = 8 комбинации. R1 (C1 = N, останатите „–“) покрива 4 комбинации, R2 покрива 2, а R3 и R4 по 1: вкупно 8, па сè е покриено точно еднаш.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Правилото за вработените (C3) е &lt;em&gt;претпоставка&lt;/em&gt; додадена за да има три услови. Напишете ја како „Assumption“ ако ја користите на испит.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#142027;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="442" width="900" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="7336-45" name="8 · CRUD matrix"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="506" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="7336-1" value="8 · CRUD matrix" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142027;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="0" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7336-2" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#5b6b73&#x27;&gt;CRUD матрица (CRUD matrix)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;htm