gn:left&quot;&gt;Решение&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Актери: Driver (примарен), Parking Sensor (хардверски уред, ја иницира Update Space Status), City Administrator, Payment Provider (секундарен, надворешен систем).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Find Free Space и Reserve Space «include» Check Space Availability. Extend Parking Time «extend» Pay for Parking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:2px 0 6px 0;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Грешка: сензорот нацртан како овал или внатре во границата. Тој е надвор, бидејќи праќа податоци во системот.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#142027;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="672" width="900" height="187" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="4967-54" name="P6 · Е-учење"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1100" pageHeight="994" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="4967-1" value="P6 · Е-учење: ERD со разложување на many-to-many" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142027;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="0" width="1000" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Scenario:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;An e-learning platform stores students, instructors and courses. Each course is taught by exactly one instructor; an instructor can teach several courses. A course consists of many lessons. Students enrol in many courses and each course has many students; for every enrolment the platform stores the enrolment date and the final grade.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Task:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;Draw an entity-relationship diagram with entities, key attributes, primary and foreign keys and the cardinality of every relationship.&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f6f8f7;strokeColor=#d5dcd8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="38" width="900" height="129" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-3" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#142027;fillColor=#dcefe9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="383" width="170" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-4" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#142027;fillColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="383" width="170" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-5" value="Student" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112" y="389" width="67" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-6" value="StudentID (PK)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="68" y="419" width="116" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-7" value="Name" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="68" y="439" width="40" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-8" value="Email" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#142027;spacing=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="68" y="459" width="48" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4967-9" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#142027;fillColor=#dcefe9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="363" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxC